      "notes": "CSRC Date Published is August 2006; its distinct History date is 09/01/06. Exact publication day is unknown, so publishedAt is null rather than inferring a day from history. Chapter 8 scoped primary-text review: sections 3 and 3.1.2: collection/examination/analysis/reporting, acquisition planning, integrity and handling records. Historical principles only, not current product commands, legal advice or production assurance. SHA-256 and the finite eight-state synthetic receipt model are this book's educational contract, not a standard-mandated certification. No full-document local PDF hash audit is claimed. 2026-09-25: Chapter20用途として公式Final landing/PDFを再確認。公表はAugust2006、正確な日付は未確定のためpublishedAt nullを保持。印刷pp.3-1/3-4/3-6〜3-8の収集・検査・分析・報告、完全性と作業Copy、複数Source・結論不能・代替説明の原則だけを採用。旧製品・取得手順・個別法的適格性・全節監査の根拠ではない。有限時刻幅/Cutoff/重複/Claimモデルは本書独自。"
